  "description": "A smarter man would have reformed his ways after being sent to juvie, but not Dennis. He's long since been too infatuated with the thrill of committing crimes and enacting violence. And when Dennis' uncle approaches him with another odd job, they're both shocked to learn that the payout may just leave them filthy rich. Their journey to dig up the treasures of the Crescent Coast begins!\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
